            }
         ]
      },
      {
         "id": "SECTION_mesoamerica",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### In America: The Mesoamerican Numbers\n\nRecent research suggests that a numerical system began to develop in Mesoamerica around <htdate0>. This may extend our earlier understanding, which placed its use around 300 BCE (<htcite0>; <htcite1>).\n\nIn the Mesoamerican system a dot is worth 1 and a bar is worth 5. Represent the proposed number with dots and bars.",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "ceffba8a-43be-4de3-a5c8-27cdf81311b1",
                     "text": "Puente, Francisco Barriga",
                     "page": "Tsik: Los números y la numerología entre los mayas",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2020",
                        "month": "",
                        "day": ""
                     }
                  },
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "ad11b3b2-8cdf-4d71-9cb7-2ac241850945",
                     "text": "Casares Contreras, Orlando, et al.",
                     "page": "Matemáticas Mayas: hechos, mitos y lo que sabemos desde la arqueología",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2022",
                        "month": "",
                        "day": ""
                     }
                  }
               ],
               "date_time": [
                  {
                     "type": "gregory",
                     "year": "-600",
                     "month": "",
                     "day": ""
                  }
               ],
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p class=\"desc\"><img id=\"atwImgMesoamerica\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('atwImgMesoamerica', '0%')\" class=\"imgcenter\"/><b>Figure 4</b>: Mesoamerica on the map of North America. Map from Mapswire (<htcite0>).</p>",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "10cd855b-c2dc-4045-8a6c-f8486ef67cfa",
                     "text": "Mapswire",
                     "page": "https://mapswire.com",
