      {
         "id": "SECTION_europe",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### In Europe: The Calculi\n\nQuipus and early abacuses are not easy to preserve, so it is difficult to know exactly where some tools were first used. For this reason, we start the European part of the tour with the *calculi*, whose use the sources we consulted date to around <htdate0> (<htcite0>; <htcite1>).\n\nOn the calculi, each column has a different place value. Markers below the bar are worth 1 and markers above the bar are worth 5. Move the markers to represent the proposed number.",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "d30b6fee-4def-401b-b5f1-b5c96f1b9d16",
                     "text": "Sugden, K. F.",
                     "page": "A history of the abacus",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "1981",
                        "month": "",
                        "day": ""
                     }
                  },
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "6d1b7315-7910-40c1-877e-c7d75b02a149",
                     "text": "Turner, J. H.",
                     "page": "Roman Elementary Mathematics the Operations",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "1951",
                        "month": "",
                        "day": ""
                     }
                  }
               ],
               "date_time": [
                  {
                     "type": "gregory",
                     "year": "-300",
                     "month": "",
                     "day": ""
                  }
               ],
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p class=\"desc\"><img id=\"atwImgEurope\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('atwImgEurope', '0%')\" class=\"imgcenter\"/><b>Figure 5</b>: Europe on the world map. Map from Mapswire (<htcite0>).</p>",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "10cd855b-c2dc-4045-8a6c-f8486ef67cfa",
                     "text": "Mapswire",
                     "page": "https://mapswire.com",
