      {
         "id": "SECTION_india",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### In Asia (India): The Hindu-Arabic Numerals\n\nWe cannot be sure when the Hindu-Arabic numerals first arose. Writing reached India only about 2,300 years ago, though numbers may have existed before that. They appear in the Ashoka inscriptions dated to <htdate0> and <htdate1> (<htcite0>).\n\nIn a sequence, each number follows the one before it by a fixed step. Look at the sequence and choose the number that is missing.",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "576e4648-77fa-4a6d-9e51-9459ced964f3",
                     "text": "Musa, Auwalu",
                     "page": "Origin of Modern Mathematical Numeral",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2024",
                        "month": "",
                        "day": ""
                     }
                  }
               ],
               "date_time": [
                  {
                     "type": "gregory",
                     "year": "-268",
                     "month": "",
                     "day": ""
                  },
                  {
                     "type": "gregory",
                     "year": "-232",
                     "month": "",
                     "day": ""
                  }
               ],
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p class=\"desc\"><img id=\"atwImgAsia1\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('atwImgAsia1', '0%')\" class=\"imgcenter\"/><b>Figure 6</b>: Asia on the world map. Map from Mapswire (<htcite0>).</p>",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "10cd855b-c2dc-4045-8a6c-f8486ef67cfa",
                     "text": "Mapswire",
                     "page": "https://mapswire.com",
