            {
               "text": "### In Russia: The Schyoty\n\nAround <htdate0>, in Russia, another tool used to represent numbers was developed: the *schyoty* (счёты). Although some people call it an abacus, we cannot evaluate possible connections between it and the earlier abacuses we studied here (<htcite0>).\n\nWrite the proposed number on the schyoty by moving the beads.",
